flowchart LR
	TRANSFORM["The whole-chain transform - applied at write time"]
	CHAIN["Exactly the raw-write normalize: true chain<br/>the core's tables and replacers - applied whole<br/>at write time"]
	NOSTREAM["No stream dispatch to gate - the tool registers<br/>NO event listener"]
	ONEPASS["The six transforms applied to the entire file content<br/>in one pass"]
	COUNT["The count being the ledger's N<br/>and the no-op condition in one"]
	TRANSFORM --> CHAIN
	CHAIN --> NOSTREAM
	CHAIN --> ONEPASS --> COUNT
